{"id":710,"slug":"scenes-from-a-marriage","title":"Scenes from a Marriage","year":1973,"country":"Sweden","duration":297,"spine":229,"url":"https://www.criterion.com/films/710-scenes-from-a-marriage","cover":"https://s3.amazonaws.com/criterion-production/films/9cc97a3bd4f3fc0e589ed556ec57c6d3/gDt8pykZ0Jq77v9lN9rKZIldYgM2E0_large.jpg","description":"\nScenes from a Marriage chronicles the many years of love and turmoil that bind Marianne (Liv Ullmann) and Johan (Erland Josephson), tracking their relationship as it progresses through a number of successive stages: matrimony, infidelity, divorce, and subsequent partnerships. Originally conceived as a five-hour, six-part television miniseries, the film is also presented in its three-hour theatrical cut. Shot on 16 mm in intense, intimate close-ups by cinematographer Sven Nykvist and featuring flawless performances by Ullmann and Josephson, Bergman’s emotional X-ray reveals the intense joys and pains of a complex bond.","boxset":0,"scraped":1,"directors":[{"name":"Ingmar Bergman","slug":"ingmar-bergman"}],"cast":[{"actor":"Liv Ullmann","role":"Marianne","slug":"liv-ullmann"},{"actor":"Erland Josephson","role":"Johan","slug":"erland-josephson"},{"actor":"Bibi Andersson","role":"Katarina","slug":"bibi-andersson"},{"actor":"Jan Malmsjö","role":"Peter","slug":"jan-malmsjo"},{"actor":"Gunnel Lindblom","role":"Eva","slug":"gunnel-lindblom"},{"actor":"Wenche Foss","role":"Mother","slug":"wenche-foss"},{"actor":"Anita Wall","role":"TV reporter","slug":"anita-wall"},{"actor":"Barbro Hiort af Ornäs","role":"Mrs. Jacobi","slug":"barbro-hiort-af-ornas"}],"credits":[{"role":"Director","person":"Ingmar Bergman","slug":"ingmar-bergman"},{"role":"Written and directed by","person":"Ingmar Bergman","slug":"ingmar-bergman"},{"role":"Cinematography","person":"Sven Nykvist","slug":"sven-nykvist"},{"role":"Assistant camera","person":"Lars Karlsson","slug":"lars-karlsson"},{"role":"Wardrobe","person":"Inger Pehrsson","slug":null},{"role":"Make